<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="worked-example">Worked Example</h2>
<p>Let’s apply the KM estimator to our example data: <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?6,%207,%209%5E+,%2010,%2012%5E+,%2015"></p>
